                'What is a realistic monthly budget for beauty D2C in Dubai + UAE?' => '<strong>Early</strong>: AED 6&ndash;15K retainer + AED 12&ndash;40K spend. <strong>Growth</strong>: AED 15&ndash;50K retainer + AED 40K&ndash;1.5 lakh spend. <strong>Scale</strong>: AED 50K&ndash;2 lakh retainer + AED 1.5&ndash;8 lakh spend. Halal certification opens Saudi + Malaysia + Indonesia additional markets.',
