                'What ROAS should a beauty brand expect and by when?' => '<strong>Skincare</strong>: 3&times;&ndash;5&times; blended (repeat + subscription supports LTV). <strong>Colour cosmetics</strong>: 2.5&times;&ndash;4&times; (creator-heavy + high creative refresh). <strong>Wellness beauty</strong>: 3&times;&ndash;5&times;. <strong>Timeline</strong>: qualified traffic 1&ndash;2 weeks, optimised ROAS 4&ndash;6 weeks.',
                'How do you handle creator + UGC pipelines for beauty D2C?' => '200+ creator roster across India + UAE + international. <strong>India</strong>: skin-tone diverse + regional-language + specific concern (acne / anti-aging / brightening). <strong>UAE</strong>: Arabic + English + expat + Arab creators. <strong>USA + UK</strong>: TikTok #SkinTok + #BeautyTok + Instagram + YouTube reviewers. Per quarter 30&ndash;50 creators paid + gifted + revenue-share. UGC harvested for paid ads.',
                'Do you integrate AR shade-match + virtual try-on for beauty?' => 'Yes &mdash; <strong>Perfect Corp YouCam Makeup</strong> (peak beauty AR platform), <strong>ModiFace</strong>, <strong>Mirrar AR</strong>. AR shade-match drives 1.5&times;&ndash;2.5&times; conversion lift + 20&ndash;40% returns reduction on foundation / lipstick / eyeshadow / hair colour.',
                'How do you handle Nykaa + Sephora + Amazon + retail placement?' => '<strong>Nykaa + Nykaa Luxe + Nykaa Man</strong>: peak India beauty marketplace + own-brand potential. <strong>Sephora India + USA + Middle East</strong>: premium retailer. <strong>Amazon India + USA</strong>: Sponsored Products + Sponsored Brands. <strong>Boots UK + Priceline AU + Ulta USA</strong>: national retail. Marketplace + retail + D2C parallel with separate KPIs.',
                'What compliance + certification do beauty brands need?' => '<strong>India</strong>: BIS Cosmetics + FDA (Ayurveda / drug claims). <strong>USA</strong>: FDA cosmetic registration + MoCRA compliance (2024 update). <strong>UAE + Saudi</strong>: SFDA + ESMA + <strong>halal certification</strong>. <strong>EU/UK</strong>: EU / UK Cosmetics Regulation. <strong>Australia</strong>: TGA + NICNAS. Ingredient claims (organic + vegan + cruelty-free) require third-party certification.',
                'Do you handle Ayurveda + wellness + traditional beauty positioning?' => 'Yes &mdash; India-origin Ayurveda beauty is fast-growing globally (Vahdam + Forest Essentials + Kama pattern). <strong>Modern-scientific positioning</strong>: ingredient + benefit + certification-substantiated. <strong>Heritage storytelling</strong>: authentic Ayurveda + tradition. <strong>International expansion</strong>: USA + UK + Australia + growing global demand for Ayurveda beauty.',
                'Do you handle vegan + cruelty-free + clean beauty positioning?' => 'Yes &mdash; values-based positioning increasingly important for younger + urban + international consumers. <strong>Certification-substantiated</strong>: PETA + Leaping Bunny + Ecocert. <strong>Operational commitment</strong>: not superficial marketing. <strong>Content + storytelling</strong>: ongoing values + ingredient + supply chain transparency.',
                'How do you handle Ramadan + Diwali + Christmas gifting for beauty?' => '<strong>Ramadan + Eid</strong>: peak Middle East + India Muslim market. Islamic-appropriate imagery + Arabic content + halal cert + gifting hampers. <strong>Diwali</strong>: India gifting + occasion. <strong>Christmas + Valentine\'s + Mother\'s Day</strong>: USA + UK + AU peaks. Occasion-specific creative + inventory 6&ndash;8 weeks ahead.',
                'Do you build subscription + refill programs for beauty D2C?' => 'Yes &mdash; skincare + haircare + specific consumables perfect subscription categories. <strong>Refill packs</strong>: sustainability + margin. <strong>Curated boxes</strong>: discovery + new-launch. <strong>Auto-replenish</strong>: predictable repeat. Subscription drives 30&ndash;45% of revenue for mature skincare D2C.',
                'How do you approach shade-inclusive + fit-inclusive beauty marketing?' => 'Shade-inclusive foundation + concealer + lip products essential globally. <strong>India</strong>: 15&ndash;20 shade range minimum for foundation credibility. <strong>USA + UK</strong>: 30+ shade range post-Fenty. <strong>Content + creator representation</strong>: diverse creator roster across skin tones + body types. <strong>Product photography</strong>: representative + inclusive.',
                'Do you handle beauty brand launches from zero?' => 'Yes &mdash; brand identity + Shopify + shade-inclusive PDP + Meta + Google + creator + PR + Amazon + Nykaa + certification. Beauty launches typically 12&ndash;20 weeks runway. First revenue in month 2&ndash;3, break-even by month 8&ndash;12 for well-positioned brands.',
                'Do you build WhatsApp + email + SMS retention for beauty D2C?' => 'Yes &mdash; WhatsApp Business API (India + UAE) + Klaviyo (USA / international). <strong>Reorder reminders</strong>: skincare runs out in 4&ndash;8 weeks. <strong>Tutorial + how-to</strong>: shade-match + application. <strong>Refill + upgrade offers</strong>: retention + upsell. WhatsApp typically drives 25&ndash;40% of revenue for mature beauty D2C in India + Middle East.',
                'How do you approach male beauty + grooming D2C marketing?' => 'Growing 15&ndash;25% YoY globally. <strong>India</strong>: post-Bombay Shaving + Beardo + The Man Company + Ustraa. <strong>USA + UK</strong>: growing male skincare + specialty grooming. <strong>Content + education</strong>: male-specific tutorials + routines + concern-focus. <strong>Creator</strong>: male fitness + lifestyle + grooming creators.',
                'Do you handle beauty brand international expansion from India?' => 'Yes &mdash; India-origin beauty increasingly successful internationally (Sugar + Plum + Forest Essentials + Kama + Vahdam patterns). <strong>USA</strong>: Delaware C-corp + Amazon USA + Sephora USA. <strong>UAE + Saudi</strong>: FZ + halal + Arabic content. <strong>UK + AU</strong>: premium retail + creator + D2C combined.',
